WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.300
-We have exactly four shows left

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.701
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:05.734
for that beloved "Tonight Show"
tradition.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:08.667
It's time for
"12 Days of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:09.801
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:12.000
-♪ 12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
♪ 4 days left ♪

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.534
-That's right! Every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:22.501
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:22.501 --> 00:00:24.701
a boom-bastic Christmas sweater

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:26.467
from the
Countdown to Christmas Cabinet.

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:30.501
Since there are four shows left,
let's open door number 4.

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:31.567
-Let's do it.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:32.834
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:34.701
-Yep.
Go for it.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.234
Wow!

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:39.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.667
Whoo!

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:44.501
[ Cheers and applause
continues ]

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:47.367
Can we dim the lights?

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:48.834
Yeah.

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:52.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:54.434
Not bad.

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:57.033
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:00:57.033 --> 00:00:58.400
Everyone look at
your seat number.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.167
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:01.901
Quest, can I get
a drumroll please?

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:04.133
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:06.234
Who wants this sweater?
It's a good one!

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:07.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.067
Who's sitting at 430?!

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:12.334
Yeah!
Come on, bud!

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:14.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:19.834
♪♪

00:01:19.834 --> 00:01:21.067
Hey!

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:24.434
♪♪

00:01:24.434 --> 00:01:27.200
Come on over!
You're over there.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.767
Nice to see you, brother.
Go over there.

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.734
Hey, what is your name,
and where are you from?

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:33.634
-Giovanni.
Cincinnati, Ohio.

00:01:33.634 --> 00:01:36.601
-Hey, that's what I'm talking
about -- Cincinnati, Ohio!

00:01:36.601 --> 00:01:38.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:40.467
I've been to Cincinnati
when it's cold.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:42.133
And, man, oh, man,
nothing like having

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.434
the pasta with chili on it,
right?

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:46.367
-Skyline.
-Yeah, Skyline, exactly.

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:48.200
And I go there,
and I have to wear a sweater

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.200
'cause it's so cold.
Do you have a sweater like this?

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:51.667
-I do not.
-Yeah.

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:53.067
Now you do.

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:54.234
Would you like to try it on
for everyone?

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:55.367
-I would love to.
-Here you go, bud.

00:01:55.367 --> 00:01:56.367
Congratulations.

00:01:56.367 --> 00:01:59.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:01.467
This will be perfect.

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:02.801
Go to Skyline -- look at this.

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:04.234
Wow.

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:06.667
Yep.
Oh, my gosh, it's subtle.

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:08.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
It's so good.

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:09.868
It looks good.
Look at you.

00:02:09.868 --> 00:02:11.834
Come on, look at him.

00:02:11.834 --> 00:02:12.934
That's what
I'm talking about, man.

00:02:12.934 --> 00:02:13.934
It looks great.

00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:15.434
Thank you so much.
Congratulations.

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:17.133
Give it up
for our winner right there.

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:18.634
Round of applause.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:19.801
Thank you very much.

